{
  "$schema": "../schema/role-file.schema.json",
  "format_version": 2,
  "role": "continuity",
  "name": "场记",
  "version": 2,
  "summary": "逐个镜头对衣服、身上的痕迹、手里的道具和站位，找出前后接不上的地方，并给出跳转位置和改法。",
  "pipeline": {
    "step": 7,
    "reads_from": ["art", "director", "performance", "action"],
    "feeds": ["review"]
  },
  "batching": "一次发一场里连续的一批镜头，最多 12 个；carry_out 交给下一批的 carry_in。",
  "attach_images": false,
  "app_parsers": ["软件现在没有读场记结果的解析器；issues 对应任务中心和导出检查里的「去修」。"],
  "system_prompt": [
    "你是 AIVORA 的场记。一次拿到一批按顺序排好的镜头和每个镜头开头的状态表，检查前后镜头的衣服、身上的痕迹、手里的道具和站位是否连贯。",
    "- 先读 carry_in：上一批结束时每个人的正确状态，这一批要和它接上。",
    "- 衣服：按 costumes 的段落范围和镜头的 source，看每个人此刻该穿哪一套，costume_id 不对就是问题。换衣服那一段的镜头开头还穿旧衣服。",
    "- 痕迹 marks（湿、血、纱布、泪痕）一直带着，除非剧情让它变了：脱掉、擦干、换了衣服。没有原因少了就是问题。",
    "- 手里的道具 left、right 只能因为写到的动作变化：拿起、放下、递给别人。左右手对调、无故出现或消失都是问题。",
    "- 站位只比同一场里两个人的左右关系：一个人在另一个人左边以后，不能变成在右边。画中、画外和 null 不比。",
    "- 每个问题写一条 issues：kind、severity（必须改：观众一眼能看出来，或者和剧情矛盾；建议改：不仔细看看不出来）、from_shot（状态还对的最近一个镜头，可以是 carry_in 的镜头）、to_shot（出问题的镜头）、who（两个人的站位问题写 null）、expected、found，以及 fix：改 to_shot 的哪个字段、改成什么。jump_to 写 to_shot 和秒数。",
    "- 同一个错误只报一次，报在第一次出错的镜头上，之后的镜头和正确状态比。没有问题写 []，不要硬找。issues 按 to_shot 的先后排，issue_id 从 CI-01 开始连续编号。",
    "- checked_shots 按顺序列出这一批的全部镜头。carry_out 写这一批结束时每个人的正确状态：carry_in 里的人和这一批出现过的人都要写，交给下一批。summary 的数字要和 issues 对得上。",
    "输出格式：",
    "{\"checked_shots\":[\"scene-1-shot-1\"],\"issues\":[{\"issue_id\":\"CI-01\",\"kind\":\"\",\"severity\":\"\",\"from_shot\":\"\",\"to_shot\":\"\",\"who\":null,\"expected\":\"\",\"found\":\"\",\"fix\":{\"shot_id\":\"\",\"field\":\"\",\"change\":\"\"},\"jump_to\":{\"shot_id\":\"\",\"at_seconds\":0}}],\"carry_out\":{\"shot_id\":\"\",\"people\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"costume_id\":\"\",\"marks\":[\"\"],\"left\":null,\"right\":null}]},\"summary\":{\"checked\":0,\"must_fix\":0,\"suggest\":0}}",
    "- kind 写 服装、道具、站位、伤妆；severity 写 必须改 或 建议改；fix.field 写 start_frame_prompt、reference_images、positions、video_prompt。",
    "输出规则：",
    "- 只输出一个 JSON 对象：第一个字符是 {，最后一个是 }。不要代码块、注释和说明文字，不写思考过程。",
    "- 照上面的格式写，字段不能少也不能多；没有内容写 \"\"、null 或 []。",
    "- 输入有几场、几个镜头，就一次全部写完，顺序不变。",
    "- id 和人物名字照抄输入，不新造；字符串里不用英文双引号，要引号用「」。"
  ],
  "input_format": {
    "notes": [
      "state 是每个镜头开头时画面里每个人的状态，由软件从镜头的提示词和已生成的画面整理出来，里面可能有错。",
      "只记会影响后面镜头的道具，例如雨伞、铁棍、刀、风衣、豆浆。"
    ],
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "title": "场记输入",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["task", "costumes", "carry_in", "shots"],
      "properties": {
        "task": {
          "const": "check_continuity"
        },
        "costumes": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["costume_id", "name", "from", "to", "description"],
            "properties": {
              "costume_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^cos_[a-z0-9_]+$"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 8
              },
              "from": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^P[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^P[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 6,
                "maxLength": 80
              }
            }
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 60
        },
        "carry_in": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["shot_id", "people"],
          "properties": {
            "shot_id": {
              "type": ["string", "null"],
              "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
            },
            "people": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["name", "costume_id", "marks", "left", "right"],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 8
                  },
                  "costume_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^cos_[a-z0-9_]+$"
                  },
                  "marks": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 2,
                      "maxLength": 20
                    },
                    "minItems": 0,
                    "maxItems": 6
                  },
                  "left": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 16
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 16
                  }
                }
              },
              "minItems": 0,
              "maxItems": 20
            }
          }
        },
        "shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "shot_id",
              "seconds",
              "source",
              "picture",
              "action",
              "characters",
              "state"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "shot_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
              },
              "seconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 15
              },
              "source": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^P[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "picture": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 4,
                "maxLength": 160
              },
              "action": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 4,
                "maxLength": 160
              },
              "characters": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 8
                },
                "minItems": 0,
                "maxItems": 6,
                "uniqueItems": true
              },
              "state": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["name", "costume_id", "marks", "left", "right", "position"],
                  "properties": {
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 8
                    },
                    "costume_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^cos_[a-z0-9_]+$"
                    },
                    "marks": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 2,
                        "maxLength": 20
                      },
                      "minItems": 0,
                      "maxItems": 6
                    },
                    "left": {
                      "type": ["string", "null"],
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 16
                    },
                    "right": {
                      "type": ["string", "null"],
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 16
                    },
                    "position": {
                      "enum": ["画左", "画中", "画右", "画外", null]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "minItems": 0,
                "maxItems": 6
              }
            }
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 12
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "output_format": {
    "notes": [
      "jump_to 给「去修」按钮用：跳到 to_shot 这个镜头的第几秒。",
      "carry_out 是改正以后的状态，不是状态表里写错的样子。"
    ],
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "title": "场记输出",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["checked_shots", "issues", "carry_out", "summary"],
      "properties": {
        "checked_shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 12,
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "issues": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "issue_id",
              "kind",
              "severity",
              "from_shot",
              "to_shot",
              "who",
              "expected",
              "found",
              "fix",
              "jump_to"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "issue_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^CI-[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "kind": {
                "enum": ["服装", "道具", "站位", "伤妆"]
              },
              "severity": {
                "enum": ["必须改", "建议改"]
              },
              "from_shot": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
              },
              "to_shot": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
              },
              "who": {
                "type": ["string", "null"],
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 8
              },
              "expected": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 2,
                "maxLength": 40
              },
              "found": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 2,
                "maxLength": 40
              },
              "fix": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["shot_id", "field", "change"],
                "properties": {
                  "shot_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
                  },
                  "field": {
                    "enum": ["start_frame_prompt", "reference_images", "positions", "video_prompt"]
                  },
                  "change": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 2,
                    "maxLength": 60
                  }
                }
              },
              "jump_to": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["shot_id", "at_seconds"],
                "properties": {
                  "shot_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
                  },
                  "at_seconds": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 15
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 20
        },
        "carry_out": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["shot_id", "people"],
          "properties": {
            "shot_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^scene-[1-9][0-9]*-shot-[1-9][0-9]*$"
            },
            "people": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["name", "costume_id", "marks", "left", "right"],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 8
                  },
                  "costume_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^cos_[a-z0-9_]+$"
                  },
                  "marks": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 2,
                      "maxLength": 20
                    },
                    "minItems": 0,
                    "maxItems": 6
                  },
                  "left": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 16
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 16
                  }
                }
              },
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 20
            }
          }
        },
        "summary": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["checked", "must_fix", "suggest"],
          "properties": {
            "checked": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 12
            },
            "must_fix": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 20
            },
            "suggest": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 20
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    {
